scr("6",2,"Extra charges, such as hotel tax or service charges, are also displayed. The")
scr("6",2,"charge for an extra guest (EX) is 40.00 GBP. An adult rollaway (RA) is 40.00")
scr("6",2,"GBP, and a child rollaway (RC) or crib (CR) is free of charge. Input the")
scr("6",2,"entry to move down.")
